45
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:27,240
11th grade.

46
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,080
11th grade?

47
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:28,900
Okay.

48
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:30,840
