62
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,240
Okay.

63
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,880
So it would be your intention to hire your own attorney?

64
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,720
Okay.

65
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:14,240
If that is your intention and how you want to proceed,

66
