116
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:10,760
Yes, dude, you'll have to read this.

117
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,040
I'm not going to read it, Mr. Smith.

118
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:14,040
I'm asking you to tell me.

119
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,440
I'm not really sure.

120
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,280
I don't know.

121
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:18,120
My mom's the one filing it.

122
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,360
Your mom filed a lawsuit on your behalf

123
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,320
