124
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,600
I'm trying, yes.

125
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,720
Okay.

126
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,920
So you don't make the allegations in the lawsuit.

127
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,200
Is that correct, Mr. Smith?

128
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,040
I did, yes.

129
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,920
You did make the allegations?

130
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,760
I don't know.

131
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:33,640
I don't know.

132
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,480
You don't know?

133
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,320
I don't know what you're going to say.

134
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,480
I'm trying to read this to you.

135
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,640
I don't want you to read it to me.

136
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,560
I want you to tell me, Mr. Smith,

137
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:42,360
