152
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:20,640
I made this point last time.

153
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:22,160
Okay, do you understand that?

154
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:24,360
You are not going to abuse your counsel.

155
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:28,000
