181
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:12,960
Mr. Gluzak, are you available on May 11th at 3.30?

182
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,200
I am.

183
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:17,240
You can appear by Zoom, Mr. Gluzak.

184
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,360
Mr. Greger, May 11th at 3.30?

185
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,640
I'm available, Jeff.

186
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:23,360
Mr. Smith, May 11th at 3.30?

187
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,680
All right, I'm going to set this matter

188
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,880
