198
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:52,000
Do you understand that?

199
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,200
Do you understand that I'm not going to tolerate

200
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:58,040
any abuse of your counsel, Mr. Smith?

201
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,960
I'm not going to tolerate your mom

202
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:02,120
