205
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:08,320
by filing that lawsuit on your behalf, Mr. Smith.

206
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:09,520
Do you understand that?

207
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,320
I've been...

208
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,200
Do you understand that, Mr. Smith?

209
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,040
Yeah.

210
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:17,080
Okay, it's not going to be tolerated in this court.

211
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:18,720
Other things that are not going to be tolerated

212
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:21,960
