217
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:33,640
Do not film court staff, Mr. Smith.

218
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,960
Do you understand that?

219
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:35,800
I don't think they have...

220
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:37,840
