224
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,280
Do you understand that, Mr. Smith?

225
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:45,120
Yes, but I...

226
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:47,640
You are not to direct anybody on your behalf

227
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:50,120
