228
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,160
Do you understand that?

229
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:52,920
I mean, nobody recorded it.

230
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:55,720
Mr. Smith, I'm not asking whether it happened.

231
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,080
I'm telling you right now

232
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,720
