240
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,200
I'm not.

241
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,040
Probably not.

242
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:24,440
I am very displeased, Mr. Smith,

243
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,720
