244
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:34,240
You are not going to harass this system any longer, Mr. Smith.

245
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,480
Any longer, Mr. Smith.

246
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:39,560
And anybody who acts on your behalf will answer to me.

247
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:41,400
Understood?

248
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:43,520
Yes?

249
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,360
Yes.

250
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,200
Okay.

251
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:47,680
You have two weeks to retain your own counsel, Mr. Smith.

252
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:50,840
If you do not do so, we will discuss how we proceed.

253
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:53,000
