261
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,680
Mr. McGregor?

262
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:05,520
No, Your Honor.

263
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:06,360
All right.

264
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,880
Mr. Smith, you may be excused.

265
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:12,240
